<title>USA: BNP orders US$61 million coal dragline.</title>
<headline>BNP orders US$61 million coal dragline.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bucyrus International Inc said Wednesday it had received a letter of intent from BHP Coal Pty Ltd of Australia to buy a 2570WS Walking Dragline.</p>
<p>The sales contract is expected to be completed in June.</p>
<p>The machine will begin production on the first day of 2000.</p>
<p>The value of the order was in excess of US$61 million.</p>
<p>BHP Coal will operate the machine at the Peak Downs mine in Queensland.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
